  "translation": "Ha umíva avei, umi oĩva hiʼári upeve Yissaskar, Sebulon ha Naftali, ogueru kuarepotiʼãramo: kuarepoti kuarahyʼãngue kuarepoti ijykégua, kuarepoti apuʼa, kuarepoti mbyky, mymba soʼo, kuarepoti oujape, hikuái rapéva, mamóne kuarepoti yvyrakuéra, yva tyaiʼỹva, kaguay yvotyraʼỹva, kuarepoti yvoty aku ha mymba parachuku hetaite haguã; jahechápa ou pe jerovia Ysraelpeguápe.",
